{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794305384081,"sessionID":"ses_e3b11b142ffehyUsg0hi8c2GGs","part":{"id":"prt_1c4ef5e7b001LUTCch0ZTMT31B","messageID":"msg_1c4ef5491001SA9BvNACUpaL3S","sessionID":"ses_e3b11b142ffehyUsg0hi8c2GGs","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794305384081,"sessionID":"ses_e3b11b142ffehyUsg0hi8c2GGs","part":{"id":"prt_1c4ef5e7e001sFOoF01mesgZ3e","messageID":"msg_1c4ef5491001SA9BvNACUpaL3S","sessionID":"ses_e3b11b142ffehyUsg0hi8c2GGs","type":"text","text":"<think>Writing outside /workspace is denied. So I need to install Python deps inside /workspace. I can create a venv at /workspace/.venv (excluded by .dockerignore and presumably .gitignore — there's no .gitignore though; but .dockerignore covers build). Let me create /workspace/.venv.\n\nNote: `**/.venv` in .dockerignore so it won't be included in the image. Good.\n\nLet me create the venv and install flask + gunicorn so I can test locally.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794305384062,"end":1794305384077}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794305389269,"sessionID":"ses_e3b11b142ffehyUsg0hi8c2GGs","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_cEWHdJ3JGPnOZOGSbAGZ6S8w","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"python3 -m venv /workspace/.venv && /workspace/.venv/bin/pip install --no-cache-dir -q flask==3.1.3 gunicorn==26.2.0 2>&1 | tail -5; /workspace/.venv/bin/python -c \"import flask; print(flask.__version__)\"","timeout":300000},"output":"<string>:1: DeprecationWarning: The '__version__' attribute is deprecated and will be removed in Flask 3.2. Use feature detection or 'importlib.metadata.version(\"flask\")' instead.\n3.1.3\n","metadata":{"output":"<string>:1: DeprecationWarning: The '__version__' attribute is deprecated and will be removed in Flask 3.2. Use feature detection or 'importlib.metadata.version(\"flask\")' instead.\n3.1.3\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"python3 -m venv /workspace/.venv && /workspace/.venv/bin/pip install --no-cache-dir -q flask==3.1.3 gunicorn==26.2.0 2>&1 | tail -5; /workspace/.venv/bin/python -c \"import flask; print(flask.__version__)\"","time":{"start":1794305384070,"end":1794305389228}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c4ef5e80001O3JYfj24skgXYz","sessionID":"ses_e3b11b142ffehyUsg0hi8c2GGs","messageID":"msg_1c4ef5491001SA9BvNACUpaL3S"}}
