{"type":"text","timestamp":1794305564053,"sessionID":"ses_e3b11b142ffehyUsg0hi8c2GGs","part":{"id":"prt_1c4f21d880015PkTYDRN1H2K1g","messageID":"msg_1c4f20bb9001dJu6E7lV7KagPj","sessionID":"ses_e3b11b142ffehyUsg0hi8c2GGs","type":"text","text":"<think>Now let me create the tsconfig.json, update vite.config.ts, and write the frontend source.\n\ntsconfig.json:\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"ES2022\",\n    \"lib\": [\"ES2022\", \"DOM\", \"DOM.Iterable\"],\n    \"module\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n    \"jsx\": \"react-jsx\",\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"noEmit\": true,\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n    \"isolatedModules\": true,\n    \"verbatimModuleSyntax\": true,\n    \"useDefineForClassFields\": true,\n    \"allowImportingTsExtensions\": true,\n    \"noUnusedLocals\": true,\n    \"noUnusedParameters\": true,\n    \"noFallthroughCasesInSwitch\": true\n  },\n  \"include\": [\"src\"]\n}\n```\n\nNote: `vite.config.ts` is outside \"include\" — tsc --noEmit on include: [\"src\"] only. But then vite.config.ts isn't typechecked. Let me include it too: \"include\": [\"src\", \"vite.config.ts\"]. But vite.config.ts imports from \"vite\" and \"@vitejs/plugin-react\" — types available. It uses `defineConfig` and `path`? No path used. OK.\n\nHmm, `allowImportingTsExtensions` requires noEmit — fine.\n\nAlso for the Node types in vite.config.ts — not needed if we don't use `path`/`__dirname`.\n\nLet me write the files.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794305564040,"end":1794305564050}}}
