{"type":"text","timestamp":1794305636175,"sessionID":"ses_e3b11b142ffehyUsg0hi8c2GGs","part":{"id":"prt_1c4f33740001UOMBQB343Dw6n5","messageID":"msg_1c4f32ba3001BOnrhBocpiglyi","sessionID":"ses_e3b11b142ffehyUsg0hi8c2GGs","type":"text","text":"<think>The last hidden button with navigate is silly — I added it to avoid an unused import. Let me remove the `navigate` import and that button.\n\nLet me fix that.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794305636160,"end":1794305636172}}}
