{"type":"text","timestamp":1794305655195,"sessionID":"ses_e3b11b142ffehyUsg0hi8c2GGs","part":{"id":"prt_1c4f3818a001O5kAREt07RFqL2","messageID":"msg_1c4f36e68001O02p3lAE5C56Co","sessionID":"ses_e3b11b142ffehyUsg0hi8c2GGs","type":"text","text":"<think>Note: `RatingStars` for a review shows `value.toFixed(1)` → \"5.0\" for a rating of 5. For reviews, an integer display is nicer. Let me adjust RatingStars to accept an optional `showValue` prop; for reviews, hide the numeric value. Let me update the RatingStars component to accept `showValue?: boolean` defaulting to true, and pass showValue={false} for reviews.\n\nNow the BookFormPage (add/edit).</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794305655178,"end":1794305655191}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794305655226,"sessionID":"ses_e3b11b142ffehyUsg0hi8c2GGs","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"edit","callID":"call_oLLYnOy5mSxP8moEvM1fjArk","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/frontend/src/components/ui.tsx","newString":"export function RatingStars({\n  value,\n  className,\n  showValue = true,\n}: {\n  value: number | null;\n  className?: string;\n  showValue?: boolean;\n}) {\n  if (value === null) {\n    return <span className={className ?? \"text-slate-400\"}>Not rated</span>;\n  }\n  const rounded = Math.round(value);\n  return (\n    <span className={`inline-flex items-center gap-0.5 ${className ?? \"\"}`} title={`${value} out of 5`}>\n      {Array.from({ length: 5 }, (_, index) => (\n        <span\n          key={index}\n          className={index < rounded ? \"text-amber-500\" : \"text-slate-200\"}\n          aria-hidden=\"true\"\n        >\n          ★\n        </span>\n      ))}\n      {showValue ? (\n        <span className=\"ml-1 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700\">{value.toFixed(1)}</span>\n      ) : null}\n    </span>\n  );\n}","oldString":"export function RatingStars({ value, className }: { value: number | null; className?: string }) {\n  if (value === null) {\n    return <span className={className ?? \"text-slate-400\"}>Not rated</span>;\n  }\n  const rounded = Math.round(value);\n  return (\n    <span className={`inline-flex items-center gap-0.5 ${className ?? \"\"}`} title={`${value} out of 5`}>\n      {Array.from({ length: 5 }, (_, index) => (\n        <span\n          key={index}\n          className={index < rounded ? \"text-amber-500\" : \"text-slate-200\"}\n          aria-hidden=\"true\"\n        >\n          ★\n        </span>\n      ))}\n      <span className=\"ml-1 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700\">{value.toFixed(1)}</span>\n    </span>\n  );\n}"},"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"diff":"Index: /workspace/frontend/src/components/ui.tsx\n===========